<title>GERMANY: RWE - 1995/96 group dividend 1.40 marks.</title>
<headline>RWE - 1995/96 group dividend 1.40 marks.</headline>
<dateline>ESSEN, Germany 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   1,200   up 10 pct</p>
<p>    Group earnings per share		 2.95    vs 2.68 marks</p>
<p>    Group sales				  65,400  up 2.9 pct</p>
<p>    Dividend				     1.50    vs 1.40 marks</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German diversified utilities group is RWE AG. Group net profit figure is net of minority interests.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
